nilla latte for $5.50\">Add · $5.50</button>\n      </article>\n      <article data-name=\"cold brew\">\n        <h3>Cold Brew</h3>\n        <p>Slow-steeped, smooth and bold <strong>$4.25</strong></p>\n        <button data-action=\"@cold-brew: Drink details for a cold brew, with size choices and add-to-order controls\">View drink</button>\n        <button data-action=\"@checkout: Checkout screen with one cold brew for $4.25\">Add · $4.25</button>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <footer>\n    <button data-action=\"@checkout: Checkout screen for Maya's coffee order, with cart summary and payment options\">View order · 0 items</button>\n    <button data-action=\"@locations: Coffee shop locations screen with opening hours and directions\">Find a café</button>\n    <button data-action=\"@settings: App settings screen with notification and ordering preferences\">Settings</button>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst search=document.querySelector('#search'),items=[...document.querySelectorAll('#menu article')];\nsearch.addEventListener('input',()=>items.forEach(item=>item.hidden=!item.dataset.name.includes(search.value.trim().toLowerCase())));\n</script>"}

